From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Josip Seketa <josip.seketa@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 06:45:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 47/69] gdb: do not hide a lost connection while reading the
 dynamic linker's r_map

A lost connection while reading r_debug.r_map during attach was printed and dropped; GDB then asserted.

diff --git a/gdb/solib-svr4.c b/gdb/solib-svr4.c
index 40b0fc55113..6496abe1367 100644
--- a/gdb/solib-svr4.c
+++ b/gdb/solib-svr4.c
@@ -846,6 +846,10 @@ svr4_solib_ops::read_r_map (CORE_ADDR debug_base) const
     }
   catch (const gdb_exception_error &ex)
     {
+      /* The target has gone, and the session cannot go on.  */
+      if (ex.error == TARGET_CLOSE_ERROR)
+	throw;
+
       exception_print (gdb_stderr, ex);
     }
 
